--- tech-stack contracts mention
19:| Application core | Electron main process and Node.js, in TypeScript on Effect | File, job queue, database, and model-process orchestration |
20:| IPC contract | `@inkling/contracts` command list and Effect Schemas | Preload, main process, and renderer share one command list; arguments are decoded before storage sees them |
